<title>PHILIPPINES: Magnum says posts net loss in 1996.</title>
<headline>Magnum says posts net loss in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Magnum Holdings Inc said on Wednesday it posted a net loss of 2.38 million pesos in 1996 on total income of 4.19 million pesos.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that expenses during the year were 6.57 million pesos.</p>
<p>The holding company did not give comparative figures.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632)</p>
</text>
